# Markdown Documentation

- Use UK English spelling.
- For documentation work, use the `project-documentation` skill in `.agents/skills/`.
- Ground content in `AGENTS.md`, `composer.json`, and repository source-of-truth files.
- User-facing `docs/` and `README.md` must not name documentation frameworks (Diátaxis, quadrants, and similar) in prose. Nav section labels are fine.
- Maintainer notes in `docs-internal/` and agent skills may reference Diátaxis openly.
- Use PSR-12 style for PHP snippets in user-facing docs.
- Preserve entertainment-only messaging; do not present the app as a forecasting tool.
